sentences.text:
The essential ingredients  of the offence under Section 498A are as follows:-
 (1) A woman was married;
 3  (2) She was subjected to cruelty;
 (3) Such cruelty consisted in --  (i) Any willful conduct as was likely to drive  such woman to commit suicide or to  cause grave injury or danger to her life,
 limb or health whether mental or  physical.
 (ii) Harm to such woman with a view to  coercing her to meet unlawful demand for  property or valuable security or on  account of failure of such woman or any  of her relations to meet the lawful  demand.
